flowchart LR
    U[User] --> MFA{MFA Challenge}
    MFA -- Pass --> RBAC[Entra ID RBAC Check]
    MFA -- Fail --> Deny1[Access Denied]
    RBAC -- Authorized Role --> Grant[Access Granted]
    RBAC -- Unauthorized --> Deny2[Access Denied]
    Grant --> Log[Sign-in Log → Log Analytics]
    Deny1 --> Log
    Deny2 --> Log
